# Local override of how many subagents a session spawns before hooks/subagent-guard.sh asks once
# (then it allows the rest of that session). Copy to
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/agents-shared/subagent-spawn-budget
# and keep it there, untracked. Without this file, or a matching line: 8.
#
# One line per account: the account name from the claude-accounts file, or * for every
# account, then a whole number or unlimited (never asks). An account's own line wins over *.
# A spawn from inside a subagent is refused whatever the budget.
#
# account   budget
*           20
personal    unlimited
